<title>JAMAICA: One killed, seven hurt in Jamaican jail unrest.</title>
<headline>One killed, seven hurt in Jamaican jail unrest.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>One prisoner was killed and seven people including a police officer were injured in a jail fight, police said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Troops and firefighters had to be called in to quell the unrest which broke out Wednesday night, a police spokesman said.</p>
